Hi all,

OpenVPN Technologies is proud to officially announce the new Trac wiki
and bug tracker at https://community.openvpn.net. Trac already plays an
important role in OpenVPN development, but we hope that in time it will
become the hub for OpenVPN resources and documentation. Trac uses the
new OpenVPN authentication service which allows the use of same
credentials on all OpenVPN services. A user account can be created by
clicking on the "Register" link in Trac.

If you encounter any issues using Trac, please don't hesitate to send
mail to Samuli (samuli [at] openvpn net). Alternatively visit the
##openvpn channel on irc.freenode.net and ask for "mattock".

Note that all new bug reports should be filed to Trac instead of the old
SF.net bug tracker, which will be closed within a few weeks.

Thanks to all OpenVPN developers and users who provided useful feedback
and helped testing Trac.

